    Framework optimization and refinement       :done, h1, 2026-01-08, 1d
    Statistics and metrics implementation       :done, h2, 2026-01-08, 1d
    Production deployment validation            :done, h3, 2026-01-08, 1d
    Final validation and testing                :done, h4, 2026-01-10, 1d

    section Phase 10 Completed (January 2026)
    MeluXina benchmarks finalized               :done, m1, 2026-01-10, 1d
    Repetition study (n=10 per model)           :done, m2, 2026-01-10, 1d
    Concurrency sweep analysis                  :done, m3, 2026-01-10, 1d
    Backend comparative evaluation              :done, m4, 2026-01-10, 1d
    Results validation and reporting            :done, m5, 2026-01-10, 1d

    section Phase 11 Completed (January 2026)
    Final report and documentation              :done, d1, 2026-01-10, 1d
